    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2em;margin-bottom:10px;\">&lsquo;Self-regulatory focus theory&rsquo; and leadership</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;\">Self-regulatory focus theory</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">People&rsquo;s focus is to approach pleasure or avoid pain</p><p>Promotion goals focus on <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p>Prevention goals emphasise avoiding punishment</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Factors that affect people&rsquo;s focus</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">The Chronic Factor</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; comes from one&rsquo;s <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">The <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> Factor</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; we are more likely to focus on promotion goals when with a <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; we are more likely to focus on prevention goals with our boss</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">How people&rsquo;s focus affects them</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">Promotion Focus: People think about an ideal version of themselves, their <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> and their gains.</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">Prevention Focus: People think about their &lsquo;ought&rsquo; self and their obligations</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Leaders</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">Leadership behaviour and <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> affects people&rsquo;s focus</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;margin-top:8px;\">Transformational Leaders:</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; pay special attention to the <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> of their followers</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; passionately communicate a clear <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; inspire promotion focus in followers</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;margin-top:8px;\">Transactional Leaders:</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; create <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> to make expectations clear</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; emphasise the results of a mistake</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; inspire prevention focus in followers</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Conclusion</p><p style=\"margin-top:6px;\">Promotion Focus is good for jobs requiring <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p>Prevention Focus is good for work such as a surgeon</p><p>Leaders&rsquo; actions affect which focus people use</p></div></div>",
    "instruction": "You will hear part of a lecture about self-regulatory focus theory and leadership.<br>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.",
